My name is Robert Samuel White. We have never corresponded. On September 3,=
 2026, Oregon State Police produced its file on me under public records req=
uest PR27478, and your March 3, 2026 email to Captain Kyle Kennedy is in it=
. The email that began everything
 the file documents. The production is published in full at oprdvolunteerab=
use.org. This letter is so the record contains, in plain terms, what you di=
d.</div>
<div style=3D"direction: ltr; margin-top: 1em; margin-bottom: 1em; font-fam=
ily: Aptos, Aptos_EmbeddedFont, Aptos_MSFontService, Calibri, Helvetica, sa=
ns-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);" class=3D"elementToProof">
I was publishing a documented record of state employees' conduct, on an ann=
ounced schedule, under my own name, and writing to the officials responsibl=
e for it. That is the activity the First Amendment exists to protect, in it=
s purest form.</div>
<div style=3D"direction: ltr; margin-top: 1em; margin-bottom: 1em; font-fam=
ily: Aptos, Aptos_EmbeddedFont, Aptos_MSFontService, Calibri, Helvetica, sa=
ns-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);" class=3D"elementToProof">
You reported it to the police.</div>
<div style=3D"direction: ltr; margin-top: 1em; margin-bottom: 1em; font-fam=
ily: Aptos, Aptos_EmbeddedFont, Aptos_MSFontService, Calibri, Helvetica, sa=
ns-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);" class=3D"elementToProof">
Not to a detective --- to the captain who manages your sister agency's publ=
ic image. And the machinery you fed did what that machinery always does. My=
 name went to a federal terrorism task force and to FBI personnel. A state =
fusion center opened documentation
 on a citizen. My driver's record was pulled. My supervisor was instructed =
to conceal from me that law enforcement was asking where I live. Satellite =
photographs of my home -- a place with no address -- were gathered and pinn=
ed so that armed men could find
 my door. They came on the anniversary of my dismissal.</div>
<div style=3D"direction: ltr; margin-top: 1em; margin-bottom: 1em; font-fam=
ily: Aptos, Aptos_EmbeddedFont, Aptos_MSFontService, Calibri, Helvetica, sa=
ns-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);" class=3D"elementToProof">
The only thing I had ever attached to that date was a document.</div>
<div style=3D"direction: ltr; margin-top: 1em; margin-bottom: 1em; font-fam=
ily: Aptos, Aptos_EmbeddedFont, Aptos_MSFontService, Calibri, Helvetica, sa=
ns-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);" class=3D"elementToProof">
Every officer who examined what you reported wrote down what it was: nothin=
g. No threat, no violence, no crime.
<b>The apparatus this state built for bombs and shooters was aimed at a man=
 for publishing the truth about it =97 and it was aimed by you, in one emai=
l, whose stated concern was that my letters were reaching the Governor.</b>=
</div>
<div style=3D"direction: ltr; margin-top: 1em; margin-bottom: 1em; font-fam=
